section The Tower of Azora
tip East along the road past Crystal Lake: Hamish Bergwort and Blixie Fitzwink stand at the foot of the tower.
accept 91725
accept 91723
section The bridge
tip Guard Thomas guards the bridge on the road east; Ormin Pelford stands just across it. His tools and Thomas's Prowlers and bears are south of the bridge, on the way back.
turnin 35
accept 37
accept 52
accept 91733
section The Eastvale Logging Camp
tip The camp is north-east of the bridge. Bundles of Wood lie around the camp and in the woods north of it.
