section Jasperlode Mine: kill these as you meet them
tip The mine is south-west of the gnoll camps. Mining Tools lie near the entrance; Kobold Geomancers hold the tunnels.
tip Careful: Mother Fang (7-10), the Mine Spiders (7-9) and Geosculptor Yip (7) are elites deep in the mine: pull the kobolds one at a time near the entrance and back out if an elite comes; they're easier with a friend.
