turnin 298
accept 301
getfp Thelsamar
section Mountaineer Ylva
tip South of Thelsamar, Ylva lies dead in the mouth of a trogg cave. Take her banner, raise it beside her and hold the spot: troggs come in waves from both sides, then Headsplitter.
accept 86585
objective 86585.0 kill
section The tunnel post
tip West to the dwarven post at the tunnel to Dun Morogh.
turnin 86585
section Fly to Ironforge
tip You have the Ironforge flight path from Dun Morogh: back north to Thelsamar's gryphons, quicker than walking through the tunnel and across Dun Morogh.
goto 33.9 50.8 Thelsamar flight master map=1432
fly Ironforge
