tip No Defias Brotherhood from Wiley (it starts with Gryan Stoutmantle's letter in Westfall): skip Westfall. North along the road from Goldshire to Stormwind: General Marcus Jonathan sits on his horse at the far end of the bridge outside the main gate. Then the gryphons in the Trade District, back to Lakeshire.
turnin 120 when !turnedin 65
