tip Master Mathias Shaw is upstairs in the SI:7 building in Old Town: the stairs are hard to see at first. General Marcus Jonathan sits on his horse at the far end of the bridge outside the main gate, then back to the gryphons in the Trade District.
turnin 135 when turnedin 65
accept 141 when turnedin 65
turnin 120 when turnedin 65
accept 121 when turnedin 65
fly Sentinel Hill when turnedin 65
section Sentinel Hill
turnin 141 when turnedin 65
accept 142 when turnedin 65
section Moonbrook and the Defias hills
tip Defias Pathstalkers and Knuckledusters walk Moonbrook; Highwaymen (level 17) patrol the hills south and east of it in pairs: pull them apart. The Deadmines entrance in the smithy is a group dungeon.
tip Careful: The camps in the hills hold mixed groups of Defias, so it is easy to pull more than one at a time if you are low level.
objective 14.0 kill when turnedin 65
objective 14.0 kill when turnedin 65
objective 14.0 kill when turnedin 65
objective 92747.1 collect when turnedin 65
section The Defias Messenger
tip South along the road to Moonbrook. The Defias Messenger starts in front of the Moonbrook smithy and walks north to the Gold Coast Quarry and the back of the Jangolode Mine, then back: look along his road. Slow him when he runs at 30% health.
objective 142.0 collect when turnedin 65
section Westfall Lighthouse
tip South-west from Moonbrook to the lighthouse on the point: Captain Grayson waits on its steps. Old Murk-Eye walks the beach and the shallows north-east of it among the murlocs: pull him away from the Oracles.
accept 104 when turnedin 65
objective 104.0 collect @ 33.7 83.9 map=1436 when turnedin 65
turnin 104 when turnedin 65
