tip Kept five Flasks of Oil from Westfall's Harvest Watchers? Captain Grayson takes them for his lighthouse fire.
accept 103 when has 814 x5
turnin 103 when has 814 x5
section Sentinel Hill
tip Back north up the road to Sentinel Hill. The Defias Traitor waits at the foot of the tower ramp; if he is missing, someone is escorting him and he is back within minutes.
turnin 142 when turnedin 65
accept 155 when turnedin 65
turnin 14 when turnedin 65
turnin 92747 when turnedin 65
accept 92748 when turnedin 65
section The Defias Traitor
tip Stay with the traitor as he walks south to Moonbrook; he does not stop for fights, so clear what follows him. His walk ends at the Defias hideout below Moonbrook.
complete 155 @ 55.7 47.5 map=1436 when turnedin 65
section Sentinel Hill
tip Back north to Gryan Stoutmantle and the gryphons.
turnin 155 when turnedin 65
