HawarysGuides.list[#HawarysGuides.list + 1] = { id = "forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains", title = "Duskwood & Redridge Mountains", faction = "Alliance", levels = "25-27", zone = "Redridge Mountains", next = "forever/alliance/05-duskwood" }
HawarysGuides.text["forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains"] = [==[guide: Duskwood & Redridge Mountains
id: forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains
level: 25-27
map: 1433
section Stormwind
tip Train, then leave by the main gate and follow the road east through Elwynn Forest.
tip Look to the Stars in Darkshire needs a Bronze Tube. Its vendors keep only one or two, and Herble Baubbletump in Darkshire is nearly always sold out: buy one at the Auction House in the Trade District on your way out. An engineer can make one too.
train only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid
vendor
section Woo Ping
tip While you're here: learn Polearms from Woo Ping (Trade District, 1 gold); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
train when !skill "Polearms" 1
section Woo Ping
tip While you're here: learn Polearms from Woo Ping (Trade District, 1 gold); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most.
train when !skill "Polearms" 1
section Tram to Ironforge
goto 64.5 7.5 Tram to Ironforge map=1453
section Shaman training
tip Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge, train with Eldrun Stormbreaker, then ride the tram back.
train
section Fly to Sentinel Hill
goto 66.3 62.7 Stormwind flight master map=1453 when onquest 272
fly Sentinel Hill when onquest 272
section Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance
tip Fly to Sentinel Hill and head north-west to the coast: the Strange Lockbox lies on the sea floor off the shore. Then head east along the road through Elwynn.
section Back to Elwynn Forest
goto 65.2 69.7 The road into Elwynn Forest map=1429
section Elwynn Forest
goto 65.2 69.7 The Tower of Azora map=1429
section Theocritus
accept 94
section Henze Faulk
tip On the road east, past the Tower of Azora, head north from the bridge to Stone Cairn Lake. Henze Faulk lies south of the lake: use the Symbol of Life on him. The Defias Rogue Wizards around him carry the Defias Script.
objective 1786.1 use @ 72.6 51.41 map=1429 only Human when onquest 1786,1787
turnin 1786 only Human when onquest 1786,1787
accept 1787 only Human when onquest 1786,1787
objective 1787.1 collect only Human when onquest 1786,1787
section Three Corners
tip The road east through Elwynn crosses into Redridge at Three Corners, where the roads to Redridge, Duskwood and Elwynn meet: south to Duskwood first.
goto 15.3 71.5 Three Corners map=1433
section Duskwood
goto 75.8 45.3 Darkshire map=1431
section Darkshire
tip Follow the road south from Three Corners into Duskwood; Darkshire lies on the east side of the forest.
tip No Bronze Tube for Look to the Stars? Herble Baubbletump, in the house beside Viktori, keeps only one and is usually sold out. Without one, right-click the quest in the guide window and skip it.
getfp Darkshire
