tip Murloc Flesheaters and Tidecallers line the south shore of Lake Everstill, just east of the gryphons and the bridge. Any of them can carry a fin.
objective 150.0 collect
section Lakeshire
tip Cross the long bridge north into town: Dockmaster Baren on the docks, Bailiff Conacher in the town hall, Martie Jainrose in her garden at the west end. Marshal Marris's Blackrock quests and Alther's Mill came with you from your first Redridge visit.
