section Drywhisker Gorge: kill these as you meet them
tip The Drywhisker kobolds dig in the gorge east of Hammerfall (Horde); skirt the town to the north. They drop the Motes of Myzrael, not Krazek's ore. Lesser Bloodstone Deposits need Mining 75: mine four ore, buy them at the Auction House, or ask a miner friend. The ore goal is optional; continue with Myzrael if you cannot get it. Careful: Every kobold type runs off for help when low on health (Kobolds at 30%, Surveyors and Diggers at 15%), which can pull more of them.
