id: forever/class/mage/teleports-horde
level: 20-50
map: 1454
section Teleport: Orgrimmar
tip At 20 go to Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits, where the mage trainers live. Thuul, the portal trainer, stands on the upper floor and teaches Teleport: Orgrimmar for 20 silver. Every teleport burns one Rune of Teleportation (10 silver at any reagent vendor), so carry a few.
level 20
train
vendor
section Teleport: Undercity
tip Take the zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar's gate to Tirisfal Glades and walk into the Undercity. Lexington Mortaim, the portal trainer, stands in the Magic Quarter with the mage trainers: Teleport: Undercity, 20 silver. Hannah Akeley beside him sells the runes.
train
section Teleport: Thunder Bluff
tip At 30. Thunder Bluff is in Mulgore: fly there from Orgrimmar or the Crossroads. Birgitte Cranston, the portal trainer, stands with the mage trainers in the Pools of Vision, the cave under Spirit Rise: go down inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. She teaches Teleport: Thunder Bluff for 80 silver.
level 30
train
section Portals to Orgrimmar and the Undercity
tip At 40 the portal trainers teach the portals: a gateway your whole group can step through, for 1 gold 50 silver each. Each portal burns one Rune of Portals (20 silver at any reagent vendor). Thuul in Darkbriar Lodge has Portal: Orgrimmar; teleport to the Undercity for Lexington Mortaim's Portal: Undercity.
level 40
train
vendor
train
section Portal: Thunder Bluff
tip At 50 Birgitte Cranston, down in the Pools of Vision under Spirit Rise in Thunder Bluff, teaches the last one, Portal: Thunder Bluff, for 3 gold 20 silver. Use your Teleport: Thunder Bluff to get there.
level 50
train]==]
HawarysGuides.list[#HawarysGuides.list + 1] = { id = "forever/class/paladin/cloak-of-the-divine-storm", title = "Cloak of the Divine Storm", faction = "Alliance", class = "Paladin", levels = "22-30", zone = "Darkshore", category = "Class" }
HawarysGuides.text["forever/class/paladin/cloak-of-the-divine-storm"] = [==[guide: Cloak of the Divine Storm
id: forever/class/paladin/cloak-of-the-divine-storm
level: 22-30
map: 1439
section The Strange Orb
tip Climb to the top of the Tower of Althalaxx in northern Darkshore. The Dark Strand Fanatics around it are easy (level 16-17), but four Dark Strand Voidcallers (level 28-29) stand in the tower on the way to the orb: each calls a voidwalker and casts Shadow Bolt from range. At 22-25 bring a friend or two, pull them one at a time and step behind a wall so they have to come to you. Loot the Strange Orb at the top: it gives you the Althalaxx Orb; right-click it to start the quest. Keep the orb in your bags until the Spear of Mannoroth: three later quests need it.
level 22
accept 78088 @ 56.2 26.5 map=1439
section Delgren the Purifier
tip Delgren the Purifier stands at Maestra's Post in western Ashenvale, south of the Darkshore road. He sends you to Stormwind with the orb.
turnin 78088
accept 78089
section Katherine the Pure
tip Katherine the Pure stands in the Cathedral of Light; she sends you to a warlock for a second opinion.
turnin 78089
accept 78090
section Ursula Deline
tip Ursula Deline, the warlock trainer, is in the Mage Quarter's warlock sanctum, down in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar. She wants 14 Summoner's Salt to read the orb.
turnin 78090
accept 78091
section Summoner's Salt
tip The Blackrock Summoners, Champions and Trackers (level 22-25, not elite) camp in the north-west of Redridge and drop the Summoner's Salt; you need 14. Two elite Blackrock Shadowcasters (22-23) stand at the cave mouth at the camp's east end: pull around them. The Blackrock camps east of Lakeshire drop the salt too, but their Shadowcasters, Sentries and Hunters are elite (level 21-24), and so is Gath'Ilzogg (26): stay in the north-west.
objective 78091.1 collect @ 23.5 12.0 map=1433
section Back to Ursula
turnin 78091
accept 78092
section Motes of Mannoroth
tip Demon Fall Canyon is in south-east Ashenvale, east of Splintertree Post (a Horde camp: go round it). The Mannoroc Lashers, Searing Infernals, Felguards and Legion Hounds (level 29-30, not elite) drop the Motes of Mannoroth; you need 12. Below about 27 they are hard alone: come with a second player or later. Felguards knock you down, Lashers cast Shadow Bolt and Immolate, Infernals keep a fire shield up. They respawn in five minutes.
objective 78092.1 collect
section The Spear of Mannoroth
tip The Spear of Mannoroth stands at the east end of Demon Fall Canyon. Hand in the motes at the spear with the Althalaxx Orb in your bags: the orb shatters, and the Shattered Orb beside it starts the last quest.
turnin 78092
accept 78093
section Return to Delgren
tip Back to Delgren at Maestra's Post in western Ashenvale, across the whole zone.
turnin 78093]==]
HawarysGuides.list[#HawarysGuides.list + 1] = { id = "forever/class/paladin/holy-mightstone", title = "Holy Mightstone", faction = "Alliance", race = "Human, Dwarf", class = "Paladin", levels = "50-56", zone = "Stormwind City", category = "Class" }
HawarysGuides.text["forever/class/paladin/holy-mightstone"] = [==[guide: Holy Mightstone
id: forever/class/paladin/holy-mightstone
level: 50-56
map: 1453
section Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
tip At 50 Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker, the paladin trainer in the Cathedral of Light, sends you to Chillwind Camp in the Western Plaguelands. Brandur Ironhammer in Ironforge gives the same quest.
level 50
accept 8415
section Brandur Ironhammer
tip At 50 Brandur Ironhammer, the paladin trainer in the Mystic Ward, sends you to Chillwind Camp in the Western Plaguelands. Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind gives the same quest.
level 50
accept 8415
section Chillwind Camp
tip Chillwind Camp is the Alliance camp at the south end of the Western Plaguelands, north of the Alterac foothills. Commander Ashlam Valorfist commands it; Argent Officer Pureheart stands in the same camp.
turnin 8415
accept 8414
section The Argent Dawn Commission
tip The Scourge drop no Scourgestones unless you wear an Argent Dawn Commission. Argent Officer Pureheart gives you one through her quest, Argent Dawn Commission, which you hand in straight away (if you already have one from Light's Hope Chapel, wear that). Equip it in a trinket slot: it shows as a buff that never runs out. Keep it on until you have 20 stones.
accept 5401 when !has 12846
turnin 5401 when !has 12846
section Minion's Scourgestones
tip Kill the Scourge of the Western Plaguelands with the Commission on: skeletons, ghouls and cultists (level 50-58) drop a Minion's Scourgestone about two kills in five. Sorrow Hill, just east of Chillwind Camp around Uther's Tomb, is the closest farm. Avoid the Flesh Golems that patrol the fields; Skeletal Guardians cast Cone of Cold and Arcane Explosion up close, Dark Summoners run for help at low health.
objective 8414.1 collect
section High Priest Thel'danis
tip High Priest Thel'danis keeps watch at Uther's Tomb on Sorrow Hill, east of the camp. He turns your 20 stones into one Inert Scourgestone: keep it.
turnin 8414
accept 8416
section Commander Ashlam Valorfist
tip Back to Chillwind Camp. Ashlam needs the voodoo of the Sunken Temple's trolls for the stone.
turnin 8416
accept 8418
section The Sunken Temple
tip The Temple of Atal'Hakkar, the Sunken Temple, lies in the Pool of Tears in eastern Swamp of Sorrows: go up the ruin's stairs, dive into the flooded hall and follow the stairs down to the portal. It is a dungeon for a group of five at about 50-55. Six elite troll minibosses (level 51-52) stand on the balconies around the temple's great round room, each behind a pack of elites on its side path. Each drops its feather every time: Gasher and Zul'Lor the Amber, Hukku and Mijan the Blue, Zolo and Loro the Green; you need all six. Hukku calls guardians and throws Shadow Bolt Volleys, Mijan heals: kill them first.
goto 69.9 53.6 The Temple of Atal'Hakkar map=1435
objective 8418.1 collect @ 69.9 53.6 map=1435
objective 8418.2 collect @ 69.9 53.6 map=1435
objective 8418.3 collect @ 69.9 53.6 map=1435
section Forging the Mightstone
tip Back to Ashlam in Chillwind Camp: he forges the Holy Mightstone. Look at the reward window before you hand in: Classic also offered the Chivalrous Signet, the Lightforged Blade or the Sanctified Orb, and Forever's notes say that choice may be gone. Use the stone before a fight against undead (Stratholme, Scholomance): it lasts ten minutes and is gone after one use.
turnin 8418]==]
