HawarysGuides.text["forever/horde/04-the-barrens"] = [==[guide: The Barrens & Stonetalon Mountains
id: forever/horde/04-the-barrens
level: 24-26
map: 1413
section Fly to Thunder Bluff
tip Fly to Thunder Bluff first: two of its elders give quests worked on this guide's and the next guide's walks.
goto 45.3 63.7 Orgrimmar flight master map=1454 when !onquest 97538
fly Thunder Bluff when !onquest 97538
section Fly to Thunder Bluff
tip Fly to Thunder Bluff first: two of its elders give quests worked on this guide's and the next guide's walks.
goto 45.3 63.7 Orgrimmar flight master map=1454 when !onquest 97538
fly Thunder Bluff when !onquest 97538
section Fly to Camp Taurajo
tip Thunder Bluff first: two of its elders give quests worked on this guide's and the next guide's walks. Fly to Camp Taurajo; from there it is a walk west into Mulgore and north to the bluffs.
goto 45.3 63.7 Orgrimmar flight master map=1454 when !onquest 97538
fly Camp Taurajo when !onquest 97538
section To Thunder Bluff
tip From Camp Taurajo follow the road west through the gate into Mulgore, then north past Bloodhoof Village to Thunder Bluff; a lift at the foot of the bluffs takes you up.
goto 47.0 49.8 Thunder Bluff's central rise map=1456 when !onquest 97538
section Thunder Bluff
tip Tal, the wind rider master, stands on the central rise: take his flight path if you don't have it. Tah Winterhoof and Zangen Stonehoof stand a short walk east of him.
getfp Thunder Bluff when !onquest 97538
accept 97538 when !onquest 97538
accept 1195 when !onquest 97538
section Fly to Crossroads
tip Fly to the Crossroads from the wind rider master: Tal on Thunder Bluff's central rise.
fly Crossroads
