tip Follow the road west past Regthar's bunkers: Seereth Stonebreak camps beside it at the edge of Stonetalon.
accept 1068 when turnedin 1062
section The road west
goto 35.3 27.9 The road west past Seereth's camp map=1413
section Malaka'jin
tip Follow the road west past Regthar's bunkers and Seereth's camp into Stonetalon: Witch Doctor Jin'Zil waits below ground in Malaka'jin, at the foot of the Webwinder Path.
accept 1058
section Shredding Machines
tip Up the Webwinder Path to Ziz Fizziks' hut, then east along the road toward Windshear Crag: XT:9 patrols the road just east of the fork, XT:4 the slopes further north-east below the crag. Both are lone shredder robots; they roam, so follow the road until you meet them.
objective 1068.2 kill when onquest 1068
objective 1068.1 kill when onquest 1068
section Sun Rock Retreat
tip Up the Webwinder Path past Ziz Fizziks and west to Sun Rock Retreat; coming from XT:4, back west past Ziz's hut.
accept 6562
accept 6393
accept 5881
accept 86576
accept 6282
