HawarysGuides.list[#HawarysGuides.list + 1] = { id = "forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains", title = "Ashenvale & Silverpine Forest", faction = "Horde", levels = "21-23", zone = "Ashenvale", next = "forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills" }
HawarysGuides.text["forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains"] = [==[guide: Ashenvale & Silverpine Forest
id: forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains
level: 21-23
map: 1440
section Taskmaster Fizzule
tip On the way north from Seereth's camp, keep east of the road to the Venture Co. tower north of the Sludge Fen. Before you go near Fizzule, use {item:8051} to fire two flares, then target him and /salute: he attacks anyone who comes in without signalling first.
turnin 2458
accept 2478
note Mission: Possible But Not Probable is for level 23 or more: the tower's drones are 25 and Gallywix a 23 elite. Do it when you can, with a group, from the Class guide Poisons (Horde).
section Kadrak
tip From Seereth's camp head north-east across the Barrens to the road north of the Crossroads; Rogues coming from Fizzule's tower head west to it. Kadrak stands on the watch tower of the Mor'shan Rampart where the road enters Ashenvale.
turnin 6541
section Into Ashenvale
goto 71.1 68.1 The road north to Splintertree Post map=1440
section Splintertree Post
tip Splintertree Post is just north up the road. Coming in from the south, the flight master and Senani Thunderheart's hunt board at Night Run come first, then the vendors. Kuray'bin at the lumber camp offers Ashenvale Outrunners: leave it for the next Ashenvale visit, at 26.
getfp Splintertree Post
turnin 6382
turnin 6383
note Senani's hunt targets (Ursangous, Shadumbra, Sharptalon) are for the next Ashenvale visit, at 26.
vendor
section Va'xug Firefure
tip On the way west, Va'xug Firefure is stuck in a ravine south of the main road, south-east of Astranaar. Shadowhorn Stags and Ashenvale Bears roam the woods all around it.
accept 98251 @ 40.4 61.5 map=1440
objective 98251.1 kill
objective 98251.2 kill
turnin 98251
accept 98252
section A Void Path
tip Steer Va'xug's Eye of Kilrogg out of the ravine to the main road within four minutes; if the channel breaks, ask Va'xug again.
turnin 98252 @ 38.2 58.1 map=1440
section Zoram'gar Outpost
tip Head west along the main road across Ashenvale, past Astranaar (Alliance: keep to the road), to the coast. Zoram'gar Outpost is on the Zoram Strand in the north-west: Marukai, Mitsuwa and Karang Amakkar stand around it, the Warsong Runner beside the flight master. Its other quests are for the next visit, at 26.
getfp Zoram'gar Outpost
accept 6442
accept 6462
accept 216
accept 6641
section Vorsha the Lasher
tip Muglash walks north up the strand to a naga brazier. Put the brazier out, then guard him through the naga waves until Vorsha is dead; the Wrathtail naga drop the heads Marukai wants.
goto 9.6 27.6 Naga brazier map=1440
complete 6641
section Naga heads
tip Every Wrathtail naga along the strand north of the outpost drops heads.
objective 6442.0 collect
section Zoram'gar Outpost
tip Back to the outpost before heading east to Thistlefur.
turnin 6641
turnin 6442
section Thistlefur Village
tip East of Zoram'gar, the Thistlefur furbolgs fill the village and the hills around their hold.
tip Careful: A Shaman at 15% health or lower runs off to find help, which can pull extra furbolgs.
objective 216.1 kill
objective 216.2 kill
section Thistlefur Hold
tip Inside the hold, Troll Chests lie along the tunnels. Ruul Snowhoof is held deep inside: free him and protect him all the way out, then he runs home to Night Run.
tip Careful: Two scripted ambushes occur, each made up of three Thistlefurs (a Shaman, a Pathfinder and an Avenger, Ursa or Den Watcher): the first when you come back to the tunnel's fork inside the cave, the second just beyond the gate where Dal Bloodclaw roams.
objective 6462.0 collect
accept 6482
complete 6482
section Zoram'gar Outpost
tip Back west to Zoram'gar. Karang offers King of the Foulweald now; leave it for the next Ashenvale visit at 26, when the walk east passes the Foulweald.
turnin 216
turnin 6462
section Splintertree Post
tip Fly to Splintertree Post: Yama Snowhoof waits in the inn for news of Ruul.
fly Splintertree Post
turnin 6482
section Fly to Orgrimmar
tip Out of the inn to the Splintertree Post flight master and fly to Orgrimmar.
goto 73.26 61.67 Splintertree Post flight master map=1440
fly Orgrimmar
section Druid trainer
train only Druid
section Orgrimmar
train
section The Binding
tip Gan'rul Bloodeye stands in the Cleft of Shadow. Use Dogran's Pendant on the summoning circle there and defeat the succubus to bind her.
turnin 1512
accept 1513
objective 1513.1 kill
turnin 1513
section Shenthul
tip If you did Mission: Possible But Not Probable with a group, Shenthul in the Cleft of Shadow takes it now.
turnin 2478 when complete 2478
accept 2479 when complete 2478
section Zeppelin to Undercity
goto 50.8 13.5 Zeppelin to Undercity map=1411
section Brill
tip Shari Stilwell trains Paladins in Brill, a short walk north up the road from the zeppelin towers. Come back down the same road for Silverpine.
train
section Strange Lockbox
tip From the zeppelin towers, run south into Silverpine and west past the Dead Field to the coast: the Strange Lockbox lies at the bottom of very deep water there, beside an air fissure where you can breathe. Watch your breath on the way down. It holds the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance for Trial of the Sea Lion. Then on to the Sepulcher.
section The Sepulcher
tip Down the road through Silverpine to the Sepulcher: from the zeppelin towers, south through Tirisfal; from the Strange Lockbox, south-east from the coast to the road. Shadow Priest Allister and Apothecary Renferrel stand by the crypt entrance.
accept 493
accept 95981
accept 516
section Deathguard Podrig
tip Deathguard Podrig stands just west of the crypt entrance: hand him Gordon's Crate from the Undercity.
turnin 6324 when onquest 6324
section Silverpine Forest: kill these as you meet them
tip South down the road past Pyrewood: Dalaran Watchers and Wizards patrol the roads around Ambermill, and south-west of the town the Ravenclaw Drudgers and Guardians haunt the ruins of Beren's Peril in the south-east of the forest.
objective 95981.2 kill
objective 95981.1 kill
objective 516.2 kill
objective 516.1 kill
section Beren's Peril
tip The Ravenclaw undead haunt the ruins of Beren's Peril, east of the road in the south-east of the forest; a Ravenclaw Guardian drops the Note Scrap that leads to the Offering Stone.
tip An elite spirit (20) often stands beside the Offering Stone: pull the Ravenclaws away from the stone before you fight them.
accept 95884
turnin 95884 @ 58.1 69.8 map=1421
accept 95883
objective 95883.1 collect @ 58.1 69.9 map=1421
turnin 95883
section The Offering of Blood
tip The quest hands you a Tortured Soul: use it beside the Offering Stone to offer your blood, then kill the elite spirit that answers.
tip The Tortured Soul is elite: grouping up is advised.
goto 58.1 69.8 Offering Stone map=1421
accept 95885
objective 95885.3 kill
turnin 95885
section Into Hillsbrad
goto 20.8 47.4 The road east to Southpoint Tower map=1424
section Southpoint Tower
tip Back on the road south. Where it turns east into Hillsbrad, Deathstalker Lesh waits at Southpoint Tower.
accept 494]==]
HawarysGuides.list[#HawarysGuides.list + 1] = { id = "forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills", title = "Hillsbrad Foothills", faction = "Horde", levels = "22-25", zone = "Hillsbrad Foothills", next = "forever/horde/04-the-barrens" }
HawarysGuides.text["forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills"] = [==[guide: Hillsbrad Foothills
id: forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills
level: 22-25
map: 1424
section Tarren Mill
tip Tarren Mill is your base for this guide: the hearth brings you back here twice. Everyone stands around the town square.
getfp Tarren Mill
objective 1536.0 collect only Shaman
accept 501
accept 496
turnin 493
turnin 494
accept 527
accept 549
accept 498
hearth Tarren Mill
section Serge Hinott
tip After returning Mission: Possible But Not Probable to Shenthul, bring Hinott's Assistance to Serge Hinott in Tarren Mill. Stay beside him until the brewing objective completes, then hand in the follow-up to learn Poisons. Finish it even if the Zanzil poison has already been removed; removing the debuff alone does not teach the skill.
turnin 2479
accept 2480
complete 2480
turnin 2480
note Poison chain unfinished? Resume your current stage in the Class guide Poisons (Horde); completed quests do not need restarting. Arrange a group for Gallywix, finish the Hinott follow-up, then return to this leveling guide.
section Bears, creepers and lions
tip West of Tarren Mill, Gray Bears, Forest Moss Creepers and Starving Mountain Lions roam the hills on the way down to the farms. The creepers drop Creeper Ichor rarely; you need only one.
objective 496.1 collect @ 54.3 39.6 map=1424
objective 496.2 collect
section Hillsbrad Fields
tip The farms east of Hillsbrad town. Farmer Ray works the field by the northern farmhouse, Farmer Getz the one further south-east; Farmhands and Farmers are everywhere. Farmer Kalaba tends the field south of the farms.
objective 527.1 kill
objective 527.2 kill
objective 527.3 kill
objective 527.4 kill
section Mountain Lion Blood
tip Careful: When one lion is attacked, nearby lions come to its aid, and the Vicious Black Bears sharing those fields can also join the fight.
objective 501.1 collect @ 54.3 39.6 map=1424
section Tarren Mill
turnin 527
accept 528
accept 546
turnin 501
accept 502
turnin 496
accept 499
turnin 499
accept 567
section Stanley
tip Stanley is Farmer Ray's dog, at the northern farmhouse in Hillsbrad Fields.
turnin 502
section Hillsbrad Fields: kill these as you meet them
tip The Peasants work the fields south of the farmhouses. Every Hillsbrad human drops skulls; the Peasants drop them most often.
tip Careful: A fleeing peasant that reaches the town hall can bring back many adds, including Hillsbrad footmen; snares, roots or similar effects keep them from escaping.
objective 546.1 collect @ 30.3 40.3 map=1424
objective 528.1 kill
objective 567.4 kill
section Tarren Mill
turnin 528
accept 98094
accept 529
turnin 546
accept 509
section Durnholde Keep: kill these as you meet them
tip Drull and Tog'thar are chained inside Durnholde Keep's courtyard buildings. Their locks need keys: Jailor Eston carries the Dull Iron Key and Jailor Marlgen the Burnished Gold Key, both in the keep. Kill them, then open both locks.
tip From Tarren Mill go south-east into the hills on the way to Durnholde Keep. Rogues and Watchmen hold the camps along the way.
objective 549.1 kill
objective 549.2 kill
objective 498.1 interact
objective 498.2 interact
section Deathstalker Masoj
tip Masoj hides on the hillside above Dun Garok, south-west of Durnholde, on the way down to the blossoms.
turnin 98094 @ 64.2 54.0 map=1424
accept 98095
section Mudsnout Blossoms
tip Just south of Masoj, the Mudsnout Blossoms grow on the hillsides above the river.
objective 509.0 collect
section The southern peak
tip Masoj wants an Apothecary Vial placed on three peaks. The southern one is the hilltop above Dun Garok, south-east of the blossoms: use a vial at the top.
objective 98095.3 use @ 74.1 73.4 map=1424
section The smithy
tip The smithy stands in the middle of Hillsbrad town. Blacksmith Verringtan and his apprentices work at the forge; the Shipment of Iron is stacked beside it. Citizen Wilkes walks the street north of it.
objective 529.1 kill
objective 529.2 kill
objective 529.3 collect
objective 567.2 kill
section The western peak
tip From Hillsbrad town climb the mountain to the north, right up to its top on the Alterac border: the western vial goes there, not on the lower slope.
objective 98095.1 use @ 38.6 94.8 map=1416
section Back to Tarren Mill
tip East along the foothills, then down into Tarren Mill.
goto 60.0 21.0 Tarren Mill map=1424
section Tarren Mill
turnin 498
turnin 549
turnin 529
turnin 509
accept 513
section The northern peak
tip The northern peak rises south-east of Tarren Mill, on the way down towards Durnholde.
objective 98095.2 use @ 71.6 30.2 map=1424
section Deathstalker Masoj
tip Back down to Masoj on the hillside above Dun Garok.
turnin 98095
section The Sepulcher
tip Walk back up to Tarren Mill and fly to the Sepulcher: Shadow Priest Allister stands by the crypt entrance.
goto 60.21 18.75 Tarren Mill flight master map=1424
fly The Sepulcher
turnin 516
turnin 95981
section Fly to the Undercity
tip Fly on from Karos Razok, the bat handler just east of the crypt, to the Undercity.
fly Undercity
section Aelthalyste
tip Aelthalyste stands in the War Quarter.
turnin 5646 only Undead
section Master Apothecary Faranell
turnin 513
accept 515
train only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
vendor
section Archibald
tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
train when !skill "Two-Handed Swords" 1
section Archibald
tip While you're here: learn Polearms from Archibald (War Quarter, 1 gold); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
train when !skill "Polearms" 1
section Archibald
tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); two-handers level a Paladin fastest.
train when !skill "Two-Handed Swords" 1
section Archibald
tip While you're here: learn Polearms from Archibald (War Quarter, 1 gold); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most.
train when !skill "Polearms" 1
section Archibald
tip While you're here: learn Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); a sword in the main hand levels a Rogue steadily.
train when !skill "Swords" 1
section Trial of the Sea Lion
tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Join the two pendant halves at the Shrine of Remulos, on the north-west shore of the lake, before you see Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven. Dendrite stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
objective 30.1 collect when onquest 30
turnin 30 when onquest 30
section Aquatic Form
tip Take Aquatic Form from Dendrite Starblaze, who stands upstairs in his building. Then Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids to Thunder Bluff: Turak Runetotem is on Elder Rise.
accept 31 when !turnedin 31
fly Thunder Bluff when !turnedin 31
turnin 31 when !turnedin 31
section Back to the Crossroads
tip Train with Turak Runetotem. Before you fly on, Tah Winterhoof and Zangen Stonehoof, a short walk east of the wind rider master, give two quests worked on the next guides' walks; then fly on to the Crossroads, where the next guide starts.
train when zone "Thunder Bluff"
accept 97538 when zone "Thunder Bluff"
accept 1195 when zone "Thunder Bluff"
fly Crossroads when zone "Thunder Bluff"
section Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
goto 60.7 58.9 Zeppelin to Orgrimmar map=1420 when !turnedin 31
section Orgrimmar
goto 51.5 45.6 The middle of Orgrimmar map=1454 when !turnedin 31
section Orgrimmar
tip Train before you fly on: the next guide flies from here to the Crossroads.
train]==]
HawarysGuides.list[#HawarysGuides.list + 1] = { id = "forever/horde/07-ashenvale", title = "Ashenvale & Thousand Needles", faction = "Horde", levels = "26-30", zone = "Ashenvale", next = "forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills" }
HawarysGuides.text["forever/horde/07-ashenvale"] = [==[guide: Ashenvale & Thousand Needles
id: forever/horde/07-ashenvale
level: 26-30
map: 1440
section Fly to Zoram'gar Outpost
goto 63.1 37.1 Ratchet flight master map=1413
fly Zoram'gar Outpost
section Zoram'gar Outpost
tip Je'neu Sancrea stands in the outpost.
turnin 6562
accept 6563
section Blackfathom Deeps ruins
tip The way to the Sapphires is through the sunken ruins at the north end of the strand: go down the stairs into the pit.
goto 14.5 14.2 Blackfathom Deeps ruins map=1440
section Sapphires of Aku'Mai
tip The Sapphires are blue crystals on the walls of the tunnels leading to the Blackfathom Deeps portal, underground and outside the instance: swim down from the pit, under the wall, into the cave. The satyrs and naga in the tunnels are elite: grouping up is advised. The crystals respawn quickly, so there is no need to go deep.
objective 6563.0 collect
section Zoram'gar Outpost
note Je'neu offers a Blackfathom Deeps quest next; leave it unless you have a group.
tip Back to Zoram'gar from the ruins before heading east for good.
turnin 6563
accept 6621
section Ruins of Stardust fountain
tip The fountain stands in the middle of the Ruins of Stardust, where Ursangous roams: use the Empty Blue Waterskin there.
objective 1534.1 collect
section Ursangous
tip Follow the main road east past Astranaar (Alliance: keep to the road). Ursangous, a big grizzly, roams the Ruins of Stardust south of the road, west of Mystral Lake. His paw starts the next hunt quest.
accept 23 when turnedin 6383
section Alonso
tip Alonso, a Forever addition, stands on the west shore of Mystral Lake with three quick Dragonslayer quests.
goto 42.4 70 Alonso map=1440
accept 78132
turnin 78132
accept 78133
turnin 78133
accept 78134
turnin 78134
section King of the Foulweald
tip The Foulweald furbolgs hold the woods east of Mystral Lake, south of the road. Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound and guard it: the furbolgs come to tear it down. Chief Murgut comes last; his totem drops in the basket.
objective 6621.1 use @ 56.4 63.5 map=1440
objective 6621.0 collect
section Torek's Assault
tip Keep east on the road. Torek waits south-west of the Warsong lumber camp. He and his grunts storm the Silverwing Outpost: let them take aggro and stay with Torek until Duriel Moonfire is dead.
accept 6544
complete 6544
section Warsong lumber camp
tip From the Silverwing Outpost head north-east to the Warsong lumber camp on the road: Kuray'bin stands there.
accept 6503
section Ashenvale Outrunners
tip The night elf Ashenvale Outrunners (23-24) stalk the woods south and south-east of the lumber camp; they stealth, so watch for them.
objective 6503.0 kill @ 72.5 69.5 map=1440
section Sharptalon
tip Sharptalon, a big nightsaber, prowls the same woods further east, on the way north to Splintertree. Her claw starts the next hunt quest.
accept 2 when turnedin 6383
section Warsong lumber camp
tip Back to Kuray'bin at the lumber camp, on the road north to Splintertree.
turnin 6503
section Splintertree Post
turnin 6544
accept 6441
section Senani Thunderheart
tip Senani Thunderheart keeps the hunt board at Night Run, by the flight master: take The Ashenvale Hunt and hand it straight back. Ursangous, Sharptalon and Shadumbra drop their trophies only after it.
turnin 6383 when !turnedin 6383
section Splintertree Post
turnin 23 when onquest 23
section Splintertree Post
accept 25
hearth Splintertree Post
accept 6504
turnin 6504
vendor
section Felmusk satyrs
tip North-west of Splintertree, the Felmusk satyrs camp in the woods. Every satyr can drop horns.
objective 6441.0 collect
section Shadumbra
tip Shadumbra, a shadow panther, stalks the woods around Raynewood Retreat, west of the Felmusk camp. Her head starts the next hunt quest.
accept 24 when turnedin 6383
section Laughing Sisters
tip The Laughing Sisters, dryads, wander Raynewood Retreat around Shadumbra's woods; one of them drops Zangen's Etched Phial, which can take several kills.
section Ashenvale Moonwell
tip South from Raynewood, the moonwell sits in a hollow west of the river, hard to see from the road; Mystral Lake is west of it. Use the Etched Phial at the moonwell to fill it.
objective 1195.1 use @ 60.2 72.9 map=1440 when onquest 1195
objective 1195.0 collect when onquest 1195
section Tideress
tip Back south-west to Mystral Lake. Tideress, a corrupted water elemental, drifts around the lake's island and under the water. She drops the Befouled Water Globe only once you have Stonetalon Standstill from Mastok; it starts a quest for Splintertree.
accept 1918
section Mystral Lake
tip Befouled Water Elementals drift around the lake's shores; the gazebo stands on the island, overlooking the Alliance outpost.
objective 25.1 kill
goto 48.9 69.6 Gazebo map=1440
complete 25
section Ursangous
tip West of Mystral Lake, Ursangous, a big grizzly, roams the Ruins of Stardust: his paw now drops for you.
accept 23 when !turnedin 23
section Sharptalon
tip On the way back north-east to Splintertree: Sharptalon prowls the woods south-east of the Warsong lumber camp.
accept 2 when !turnedin 2
section Splintertree Post
turnin 23 when onquest 2,23,24
turnin 2 when onquest 2,23,24
turnin 24 when onquest 2,23,24
section Splintertree Post
turnin 247
turnin 6441
section Splintertree Post
turnin 25
section Splintertree Post
turnin 1918 when onquest 1918
accept 824 when onquest 1918
section Zoram'gar Outpost
fly Zoram'gar Outpost
turnin 6621
section Zoram'gar Outpost
turnin 824 when onquest 824
section Fly to Thunder Bluff
tip Fly to Thunder Bluff from Zoram'gar. If you don't know its flight path, fly to Camp Taurajo and walk north through Mulgore instead.
goto 12.2 33.8 Zoram'gar Outpost flight master map=1440
fly Thunder Bluff
section Skywatcher Plateau
tip The Earthen Ring camp and its three quests stand up on Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff. Fly to Thunder Bluff if you know its flight path and take a lift down, else fly to Camp Taurajo and walk north through Mulgore; the arrow then leads round to the plateau's north end and up onto it.
goto 40.6 22.2 North of Thunder Bluff map=1412
section Skywatcher Plateau
goto 30.5 8.2 Skywatcher Plateau map=1412
section The Earthen Ring
tip The Earthen Ring camp stands north of the bluffs: Mazu'kon, Yorn Grimtotem and Muln Earthfury. From Thunder Bluff, take a lift down; coming on foot from Camp Taurajo, keep north past the bluffs.
accept 96260
accept 96241 @ 32.5 20.6 map=1412
accept 96259
section Gloomrise: kill these as you meet them
tip North of the camp, spiders overrun the burial ground at Gloomrise. Use Mazu'kon's Toxin Extractor on the Gnawed Corpses; the Spinners drop the Crystalline Silk. Broodmother Valraxx sits at the north end: her Bloody Parchment starts A Darker Truth.
objective 96260.1 collect
objective 96259.2 kill
objective 96259.1 kill
objective 96241.1 collect
section The Earthen Ring
tip Muln Earthfury offers The Broodmother only once Defending the Dead is handed in.
turnin 96260
turnin 96241
turnin 96259
section The Broodmother
accept 96261 when group 96261
section Broodmother Valraxx
tip Broodmother Valraxx sits at the north end of Gloomrise; her Bloody Parchment starts A Darker Truth. Broodmother Valraxx is elite: grouping up is advised.
objective 96261.1 kill when group 96261
accept 96294 when group 96261
section The Earthen Ring
tip Back south to the camp, then up into Thunder Bluff for the flight to Camp Taurajo.
turnin 96261 when group 96261
turnin 96294 when group 96261
section Class trainer
train only Paladin,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Druid
section Thunder Bluff
goto 47.0 49.8 Thunder Bluff's central rise map=1456
section Thunder Bluff
tip Into Thunder Bluff by a lift: Tal, the wind rider master, stands on the central rise. Take his flight path if you don't know it yet.
getfp Thunder Bluff
objective 93739.3 kill
section Zangen Stonehoof
tip Zangen Stonehoof stands a short walk east of Tal.
turnin 1195 when complete 1195
