section Fly to Camp Taurajo
goto 46.7 49.9 Thunder Bluff flight master map=1456
fly Camp Taurajo
section Brine
tip Brine's hut stands on the ridge above the quilboar watering hole south of Camp Taurajo, on the road to the Great Lift.
turnin 1534
accept 220
section Tear of the Moons
tip On the road south to the Great Lift, turn east into the Bael Modan dig. Feegly the Exiled hides at its south edge. General Twinbraid's Strongbox stands on the bottom floor of the dwarves' fortress, beside General Twinbraid (30) and his Officers (26): pull them to you one at a time.
accept 857
objective 857.0 collect @ 49.1 84.3 map=1413
turnin 857
section The Great Lift
goto 31.9 23.9 The Great Lift, down into Thousand Needles map=1441
section Freewind Post's lift
goto 44.9 48.9 Freewind Post's lift map=1441
section Freewind Post
tip Ride the lift down, then follow the road east through the canyons to Freewind Post, a Tauren village on top of the mesas. Its lift is on the north side.
getfp Freewind Post
accept 4767
accept 4821
turnin 4542
accept 4841
accept 5147
accept 98070
accept 98069
section Rau Cliffrunner
tip Rau Cliffrunner stands in Freewind Post: Zangen's filled phial is for him.
turnin 1196 when onquest 1196
accept 1197 when onquest 1196
section Alien Egg
tip Take the lift down. The egg lies in a nest on the canyon floor in one of three spots: south-east of the mesas (52.3,55.2), east (56.4,50.4) or south-west (37.6,56.1).
objective 4821.0 collect @ 37.6 56.1 map=1441
section Galak centaurs
tip The Galak camps fill the canyon north of Freewind; Scouts, Wranglers and Windchasers share every camp. A lone Galak Messenger walks a long path between the camps: if you meet him, kill him, his note starts a quest for Whitereach Post. Don't wait for him.
objective 4841.1 kill
objective 4841.2 kill
objective 4841.3 kill
accept 4881
section Splithoof Hold
tip A short walk north of the Galak camps, the cave of Splithoof Hold leads down to its deepest chamber, where the Ancient Brazier burns. Use the Filled Etched Phial on it, then loot the Cloven Hoof at once: the flame only stays out briefly, and if it relights the phial is gone. Then east to Dorn's mesa.
tip Careful: Two Galak Flame Guards (30) stand by the brazier and a centaur guard walks the cave: pull them away one at a time before you douse the flame.
objective 1197.1 use @ 42.0 31.5 map=1441 when onquest 1197
objective 1197.0 collect @ 42.0 31.5 map=1441 when onquest 1197
section Dorn Plainstalker
tip Dorn Plainstalker stands on a mesa top east of the Galak camps. For the Test of Faith, walk off the end of the planks beside him: you land safely.
accept 1149
complete 1149
turnin 1149
accept 1150
section Freewind Post
turnin 4841
accept 5064
turnin 4821
accept 4865
hearth Freewind Post
section Rau Cliffrunner
turnin 1197 when complete 1197
section Darkcloud Pinnacle
tip West of Freewind, the Grimtotem camps below Darkcloud Pinnacle. The Secret Notes are in Document Chests at the south-east, south-west and north-west camps.
objective 5064.3 interact @ 39.3 41.5 map=1441
objective 5064.2 interact @ 33.8 40.0 map=1441
objective 5064.1 interact @ 31.8 32.6 map=1441
section Level 28.9
tip Short of 28.9? The Grimtotem around these camps (25-28) are the right level: kill a few more before the climb to Lakota. Past it, this step skips itself. Or, with a group, run the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon or the Razorfen Kraul dungeon instead.
goto 35.0 31.5 Grimtotem camps below Darkcloud Pinnacle map=1441 when level<28.9
level 28.9 when level<28.9
section Lakota Windsong
tip Climb the path to the top of Darkcloud Pinnacle. Lakota Windsong is held captive beside Arnak Grimtotem (29): clear the guards and Arnak first, then free her and protect her on the walk down; Grimtotem ambushers come at you on the way.
objective 5147.0 collect @ 38.1 26.9 map=1441
accept 4904 @ 37.95 26.45 map=1441
complete 4904
section Highperch
tip West of Whitereach the wyverns nest on the Highperch cliffs; the eggs lie in the nests. Pao'ka Swiftmountain waits on the east side of the nesting grounds: free him and keep him alive on the walk back to Whitereach Post.
tip Careful: Wyverns at level 28-29 fly overhead and can be pulled without warning. A group of three wyverns can ambush you once you pass the first pillar at the bottom.
objective 4767.0 collect
accept 4770
complete 4770
section Whitereach Post
turnin 4770
turnin 4865
note Motega's next quest, Sacred Fire, ends in Thunder Bluff, off this route. Skip it.
section Kanati Greycloud
tip Only if the Galak Messenger dropped his plot for you: Kanati Greycloud stands at Whitereach Post.
turnin 4881 when onquest 4881,4966
accept 4966 when onquest 4881,4966
section Wizlo Bearingshiner
accept 5151 when group 5151
section Hypercapacitor Gizmo
tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Enraged Panther is a level 30 elite: most classes solo it at level 32, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
objective 5151.1 collect @ 22.8 24.6 map=1441 when group 5151
