section Level 29.49
tip If you skipped Hypercapacitor Gizmo and are still short of 29.49, kill harpies here first: Roguefeather Den is your next stop anyway. Past it, this step skips itself. Or, with a group, run the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon or the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Graveyard) instead.
goto 27.0 51.9 Screeching Roguefeather map=1441 when level<29.49
level 29.49 when level<29.49
section The Screeching Canyon: kill these as you meet them
tip South of Darkcloud, the harpies of Roguefeather Den. Grenka Bloodscreech (31) walks among them: thin out the harpies around her before you pull her. The Screeching Harpies, Roguefeathers and Windcallers there are Jandia's; her Stolen Freewind Supplies lie on the ground along the foot of the cliff and in the cave up on top.
objective 98070.2 kill
objective 98070.3 kill
objective 98070.1 kill
objective 98069.0 collect @ 27.0 51.9 map=1441
objective 1150.0 collect
section Freewind Post
tip Back east to Freewind Post: it lies on the way from Roguefeather Den to Dorn's mesa.
turnin 4767
turnin 5147
turnin 5064
turnin 4904
turnin 98070
turnin 98069
vendor
section Test of Endurance
tip Dorn Plainstalker's mesa is north-east of Freewind.
turnin 1150
accept 1151
section Rok'Alim the Pounder
tip Rok'Alim, a hard-hitting rock elemental, walks the cliffs of Highperch, back west past Whitereach Post. Rok'Alim the Pounder is elite: grouping up is advised.
objective 1151.0 collect
turnin 1151
section Freewind Post
tip Back to Freewind Post. The Mirage Raceway's quests come with the next visit to the Shimmering Flats, at 33.
note The next guide flies on from here to the Crossroads and Orgrimmar.]==]
