section High Executor Darthalia
tip You missed Darthalia's first errands, from the 22-25 Hillsbrad guide: they come first now. They are a few levels below you and quick, and they open the rest of the Battle of Hillsbrad in this guide.
accept 527 when !turnedin 529
section Krusk
tip Krusk wants his two scouts freed from Durnholde Keep before he trusts you with Infiltration.
accept 498 when !turnedin 498
section Hillsbrad Fields
tip West past the hills to the farms east of Hillsbrad town. Farmer Ray works the field by the northern farmhouse, Farmer Getz the one further south-east; Farmhands and Farmers are everywhere.
objective 527.1 kill when !turnedin 529
objective 527.2 kill when !turnedin 529
objective 527.3 kill when !turnedin 529
objective 527.4 kill when !turnedin 529
section Tarren Mill
tip Back east to Tarren Mill.
turnin 527 when !turnedin 529
accept 528 when !turnedin 529
section Hillsbrad Peasants
tip Back to the fields: the Peasants work south of the farmhouses. Careful: A fleeing peasant that reaches the town hall can bring back adds; snares or roots keep them from escaping.
objective 528.1 kill when !turnedin 529
section Tarren Mill
turnin 528 when !turnedin 529
accept 529 when !turnedin 529
section Durnholde Keep
tip South-east of Tarren Mill. Drull and Tog'thar are chained in the keep's courtyard buildings: Jailor Eston carries the Dull Iron Key and Jailor Marlgen the Burnished Gold Key, both in the keep. Kill them, then open both locks.
objective 498.1 interact when !turnedin 498
objective 498.2 interact when !turnedin 498
section The smithy
tip West across the foothills to Hillsbrad town: the smithy stands in the middle of it. Blacksmith Verringtan and his apprentices work at the forge; the Shipment of Iron is stacked beside it.
objective 529.1 kill when !turnedin 529
objective 529.2 kill when !turnedin 529
objective 529.3 collect when !turnedin 529
section Krusk
tip Back to Tarren Mill.
turnin 498 when !turnedin 498
