section Helcular's Rod
tip South-west, the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-32) fill the Foothill Caverns in the hills west of Tarren Mill; about one in sixteen carries the rod. Stay in these caverns: the Mountain and Giant Yetis (32-34) of the cave further north carry it too, but at 29-30 they hit hard and come in pairs.
objective 552.0 collect @ 44.5 29.4 map=1424
section Level 30
tip Tarren Mill's Prison Break In, Stone Tokens and The Hammer May Fall are offered from level 30. Below it? Keep killing the yetis in these caves until level 30. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Graveyard) or the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon instead.
goto 44.0 28.0 Foothill Caverns map=1424 when level<30
level 30 when level<30
section Town hall
tip On to Hillsbrad town, south-west of the yeti caves. The town hall is on the town's west side: Magistrate Burnside (30) and Clerk Horrace Whitesteed are inside with the Town Registry; the Proclamation is pinned up beside it. Councilmen walk the town.
objective 532.2 kill
objective 532.3 interact
objective 532.4 collect
objective 567.1 kill
objective 532.1 kill
section Tarren Mill
tip Back east to Tarren Mill.
turnin 532
