section Foothill Caverns
tip Back into the yeti caves west of Tarren Mill with the Rod of Helcular. The path splits just inside: the Flame of Azel burns on the upper level to the right, the Flame of Veraz on the lower level to the left, past more yetis.
objective 553.1 use @ 43.9 28.1 map=1424
objective 553.2 use @ 44.1 26.6 map=1424
section Flame of Uzel
tip The third flame burns in the smaller cave up in the hills north of the caverns.
tip Careful: Giant and Mountain Yetis (32-34) stand around the flame, often in pairs, and Frostmaw, a rare yeti (37), roams nearby. At 30-31 they are over your level: pull the yetis one at a time from the cave mouth before you use the Rod, and watch for Frostmaw before you go in.
objective 553.3 use @ 41.7 6.4 map=1424
section Alterac Mountains
goto 24.5 82.8 The Dalaran crater's eastern rim map=1416
section The Dalaran crater
tip Head west along the foot of the mountains to the violet dome of Dalaran. Ricter, Alina and Dermot (33-34) stand together inside the crater's eastern rim, Kegan Darkmar (35) a little west of them; each carries one Bloodstone piece. The Shield Guards and Theurgists (31-33) around them drop the Worn Stone Tokens. Careful: Many guards stand in linked pairs and others patrol alone around the camp.
objective 544.1 collect
objective 544.2 collect
objective 544.3 collect
objective 544.4 collect
objective 93680.1 collect @ 16.4 89.3 map=1416
objective 556.0 collect
section Hillsbrad Foothills
goto 28.5 55.0 Azurelode Mine map=1424
section Azurelode Mine
tip Head south past Hillsbrad town to the Azurelode Mine. Miners work the tunnels; Foreman Bonds (30) and Miner Hackett (29) are deep inside.
objective 539.2 kill
objective 567.3 kill
objective 539.1 kill
section Torn Fin murlocs
tip The Torn Fin murlocs camp on the beaches south-west of Southshore's bay, below the mine.
goto 36.0 68.0 Torn Fin beach map=1424 when onquest 515
objective 515.3 collect when onquest 515
section Helcular's Grave
tip Head east to Southshore's graveyard, on the north-east edge of the town: Helcular's grave lies among the others. Come at it from the north and keep away from the town's guards.
turnin 553 @ 52.8 53.4 map=1424
section Daggerspine naga
tip The Daggerspine naga line the shore south-east of the town.
goto 53.0 65.0 Daggerspine shore map=1424 when onquest 515
objective 515.2 collect when onquest 515
section Henchman Valik
tip From Southshore head north past Tarren Mill and follow the road on into the Alterac foothills. Valik waits by the Syndicate camp. He offers his errand only while you carry Krusk's Infiltration: hand him the stout at once, and his reward is the Syndicate Missive Krusk wants. A missive from the Syndicate here does the same: with one in your bags the guide passes Valik.
accept 535 when !complete 533
turnin 535 when !complete 533
section Syndicate missives
tip Only if Valik's missive didn't come your way: the Syndicate Footpads and Thieves (32-34) around the camps west of the road carry missives too; about one in three drops one. Careful: at 31-32 they are still above you and stand close together, with Wizards (34-35) among them: pull one at a time from the camp's edge.
objective 533.0 collect
section Tarren Mill
tip Head back south down the road to Tarren Mill.
turnin 533
turnin 539
turnin 567
turnin 556
turnin 544
turnin 93680
