section Clam beds
tip West to the shore. Giant Softshell Clams lie in the shallows and the Enraged Reef Crawlers walk the beach: each clam you open on the sea floor, and some crawlers, give a Soft-shelled Clam. Open each one in your bags for its meat.
tip The Drysnap Crawlers and Pincers on the same beach carry Rackmore's Silver Key, about one in seven.
