tip Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Kar Stormsinger in Bloodhoof Village, with Harb Clawhoof's kodos (20 gold each) beside him. Ride back up to Thunder Bluff's flight master afterwards.
train when level>=40
