section Mirage Raceway
tip The road from Freewind Post to Tanaris runs past the Mirage Raceway on the Shimmering Flats: Fizzle Brassbolts is in the gnomes' camp beside the track, Pozzik and Zamek by the goblins' camp. Pozzik first, then Zamek, who runs off to keep Rizzle busy; then take Rizzle's plans from the gnomes' camp and bring them back to Pozzik.
