section Revantusk Village
tip Separation Anxiety, Kidnapped Elder Torntusk! and Dark Vessels are group quests: they send you into Jintha'Alor, whose trolls are elite (46-50). Take them with a group of three or more; skip them if you are alone, the route has you grind the experience back.
tip Primal Torntusk stands up on top of the inn, above Lard: go up, the arrow cannot tell the levels apart.
accept 7849 when group 7849
accept 7845 when group 7849
accept 7850 when group 7849
section The Overlook Cliffs: kill these as you meet them
tip The big turtles crawl along the beaches north of the village, and Whiskey Slim's bottles of port lie on the same beaches, from the village up to the Overlook Cliffs: pick them up as you go. A snapjaw can drop OOX-09/HL's distress beacon, rarely: keep it.
objective 7815.1 kill
objective 580.1 collect
section The Overlook Cliffs: kill these as you meet them
tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Gammerita is a level 48 elite: most classes solo it at level 50, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
tip Gammerita walks the shore below the Overlook Cliffs, from the arrow south to about 75,66 and north to about 82,52: if she isn't at the arrow, follow the shore.
