section Tirisfal Glades: kill these as you meet them
tip Greater Duskbats fly over the fields around Brill and along the road north: Gretchen wants their pelts, Shelene their wings.
tip The Doom Weed grows in the graveyard fields just north of Brill, where the Rot Hide Graverobbers dig; all the Rot Hides drop the ichor.
tip The Rot Hide Mongrels hold the hills further north. Maggot Eye (level 11) stands in their camp on the hill south of the shore: clear the gnolls around him first.
tip Careful: Gnoll guards stand outside the hut and can join the fight. If you slip past them and fight him inside, he fights alone.
tip The Vile Fin murlocs line the north shore: they all drop the scales, and the Minor Oracles and Muckdwellers the skins for Shelene.
